Gershwin Workspace
==================

url    = https://github.com/gershwin-desktop/gershwin-workspace.git
tag    = 26.09
commit = 817491d7dc7de207c3e71938b69f0f6d56000a81
date   = 2026-09-17

Built by tools/desktop/build-workspace.sh, which foxyn-desktop(8) runs
on the desktop image (tools/linux/build.sh desktop): it downloads this
revision's archive, checks its SHA-256, applies
tools/desktop/patches/workspace-dragonfly.txt and installs in /System
(docs/desktop-workspace.md). It is not part of buildworld. Keep build
output outside the submodule. When upgrading, update the revision and
checksum in build-workspace.sh too.
License: GPL text in COPYING; individual source and asset terms require review. Complete provenance review and preserve applicable notices
and source obligations before distributing selected components.
On upgrade, review dependencies, ABI, installation paths and desktop tests.
